fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analyticsoverlay/objectdetectionoverlay.html#objectdetectionoverlay:filled-box","fragment":"\n\tfilled-box\n\nDraw filled-box in the region where the object is detected is masked.\nFilling color will be based on object-detection-outline-color.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});